nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 173.14.39.

Hardware: GeForce FX 5xxx series (NV3x)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2013. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 19.

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-173xx-.*'
